repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/protflash-amp-classifier"
url: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/protflash-amp-classifier"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch pipeline for antimicrobial peptide classification using ProtFlash
  protein embeddings, AAontology enrichment, Mean/Gated pooling strategies,
  and MLP/CNN/BiLSTM classifiers, including external validation and
  explainability analysis.
